item 71 phase 1 todo "Restrict handwritten versioned repository content to Agda and Markdown only. Any generated or governed materialization may use its required target format. Until GV38 is completed, the only handwritten bootstrap escape hatch is root-level `devenv.nix`, `devenv.yaml`, and `devenv.lock`; all other implementation languages and handwritten configuration formats, including Nix elsewhere, are forbidden."
item 72 phase 1 todo "Require every versioned repository artifact not permitted as handwritten source by GV71, except the temporary root-level `devenv.nix`, `devenv.yaml`, and `devenv.lock` bootstrap escape hatch, to be produced by exactly one governed `Govenv.Materialization.*` definition and verified against its materialized state; transient `.govenv` state is forbidden from being versioned."
